  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CuspTraceSum.hasSum_mCusp_repTrace | exact GlobalTheory.CuspTraceSum.hasSum_mCusp_repTrace | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CuspTraceSum.hasSum_mCusp_repTrace <;> assumption)
